2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (The\040lasso\040method\040for\040variable\040selection\040in\040the\040cox\040model)
/Author (Robert\040Tibshirani)
/Subject (SUMMARY\040I\040propose\040a\040new\040method\040for\040variable\040selection\040and\040shrinkage\040in\040Cox\220s\040proportional\040hazards\040model\056\040My\040proposal\040minimizes\040the\040log\040partial\040likelihood\040subject\040to\040the\040sum\040of\040the\040absolute\040values\040of\040the\040parameters\040being\040bounded\040by\040a\040constant\056\040Because\040of\040the\040nature\040of\040this\040constraint\054\040it\040shrinks\040coe\206cients\040and\040produces\040some\040coe\206cients\040that\040are\040exactly\040zero\056\040As\040a\040result\040it\040reduces\040the\040estimation\040variance\040while\040providing\040an\040interpretable\040final\040model\056\040The\040method\040is\040a\040variation\040of\040the\040\217lasso\220\040proposal\040of\040Tibshirani\054\040designed\040for\040the\040linear\040regression\040context\056\040Simulations\040indicate\040that\040the\040lasso\040can\040be\040more\040accurate\040than\040stepwise\040selection\040in\040this\040setting\056)
/Keywords (28\040Feb\0401997\054\040Statistics\040in\040Medicine\054\040Lasso\040\050statistics\051\054\040Feature\040selection\054\040Linear\040regression\054\040University\040of\040Toronto)
>>
endobj
